      "html": "<style>body{line-height:var(--leading-ui)}\n\n  :root{\n    color-scheme: light dark;\n    --background: light-dark(oklch(0.968 0.026 88), oklch(0.185 0.020 40));\n    --foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.255 0.045 45), oklch(0.945 0.030 85));\n    --card: light-dark(oklch(0.994 0.008 88), oklch(0.235 0.022 40));\n    --card-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.255 0.045 45), oklch(0.945 0.030 85));\n    --popover: var(--card);\n    --popover-foreground: var(--card-foreground);\n    --primary: light-dark(oklch(0.505 0.180 32), oklch(0.700 0.170 33));\n    --primary-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.990 0.010 90), oklch(0.190 0.045 32));\n    --secondary: light-dark(oklch(0.940 0.038 86), oklch(0.262 0.024 42));\n    --secondary-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.255 0.045 45), oklch(0.945 0.030 85));\n    --muted: light-dark(oklch(0.936 0.034 86), oklch(0.258 0.022 42));\n    --muted-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.470 0.040 48), oklch(0.745 0.032 80));\n    --accent: light-dark(oklch(0.520 0.150 138), oklch(0.780 0.140 138));\n    --accent-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.985 0.010 90), oklch(0.200 0.040 138));\n    --destructive: light-dark(oklch(0.480 0.185 22), oklch(0.660 0.170 22));\n    --destructive-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.990 0.010 90), oklch(0.190 0.045 22));\n    --border: light-dark(oklch(0.885 0.030 70), oklch(0.330 0.022 45));\n    --input: light-dark(oklch(0.865 0.032 68), oklch(0.350 0.024 45));\n    --ring: light-dark(oklch(0.505 0.180 32), oklch(0.700 0.170 33));\n    --chart-gift: light-dark(oklch(0.600 0.155 138), oklch(0.800 0.130 138));\n    --chart-credit: light-dark(oklch(0.460 0.165 25), oklch(0.560 0.150 25));\n    --chart-gift-wash: color-mix(in oklab, var(--chart-gift) 45%, var(--background));\n    --chart-credit-wash: color-mix(in oklab, var(--chart-credit) 45%, var(--background));\n    --chart-gift-ink: color-mix(in oklab, var(--chart-gift) 70%, var(--foreground));\n    --chart-credit-ink: color-mix(in oklab, var(--chart-credit) 70%, var(--foreground));\n    --chart-rim: color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 40%, var(--background));\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n    --radius-sm: calc(var(--radius) * 0.5);\n    --radius-md: var(--radius);\n    --radius-lg: calc(var(--radius) * 1.5);\n    --radius-xl: calc(var(--radius) * 2);\n  --border-width-thin: 1px;\n  --border-width-medium: 2px;\n  --border-width-thick: 3px;\n    --font-display: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    --font-sans: Seravek, \"Gill Sans Nova\", Ubuntu, Calibri, \"Noto Sans\", \"DejaVu Sans\", source-sans-pro, sans-serif;\n    --font-mono: ui-monospace, \"Cascadia Code\", \"Source Code Pro\", Menlo, Consolas, \"DejaVu Sans Mono\", monospace;\n    --leading-solid: 1;\n    --leading-tight: 1.2;\n    --leading-ui: 1.45;\n    --leading-body: 1.55;\n    --tracking-tight: -0.01em;\n    --tracking-display: -0.02em;\n    --tracking-caps: 0.14em;\n  \n    --spacing: 0.25rem;\n    --font-base: 1rem;\n    --text-2xs: calc(var(--font-base) * 0.625);\n    --text-xs: calc(var(--font-base) * 0.75);\n    --text-sm: calc(var(--font-base) * 0.875);\n    --text-base: calc(var(--font-base) * 1);\n    --text-lg: calc(var(--font-base) * 1.125);\n    --text-xl: calc(var(--font-base) * 1.5);\n    --text-2xl: calc(var(--font-base) * 1.875);\n    --text-4xl: calc(var(--font-base) * 2.5);\n    --space-1: calc(var(--spacing) * 1);\n    --space-2: calc(var(--spacing) * 2);\n    --space-3: calc(var(--spacing) * 3);\n    --space-4: calc(var(--spacing) * 4);\n    --space-5: calc(var(--spacing) * 5);\n    --space-6: calc(var(--spacing) * 6);\n    --space-7: calc(var(--spacing) * 7);\n    --space-8: calc(var(--spacing) * 8);\n    --space-9: calc(var(--spacing) * 9);\n    --space-10: calc(var(--spacing) * 10);\n    --space-11: calc(var(--spacing) * 11);\n    --space-12: calc(var(--spacing) * 12);\n    --space-13: calc(var(--spacing) * 13);\n    --space-14: calc(var(--spacing) * 14);\n    --space-15: calc(var(--spacing) * 15);\n    --space-16: calc(var(--spacing) * 16);\n    --space-17: calc(var(--spacing) * 17);\n    --space-18: calc(var(--spacing) * 18);\n    --space-19: calc(var(--spacing) * 19);\n    --space-20: calc(var(--spacing) * 20);}\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  .sheet{\n  min-block-size: 1180px; padding-block: var(--space-14) var(--space-11); display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap: var(--space-8); background:var(--background); color:var(--foreground); font-family:var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height:var(--leading-body); box-sizing: border-box; inline-size: 100%; max-inline-size: calc(var(--page-measure) + var(--space-page) * 2); margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: var(--space-page)\n}\n  header{flex:none}\n  .kicker{\n    margin:0;font-size: var(--text-xs);letter-spacing: var(--tracking-caps);text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:var(--primary);font-weight:700;\n  }\n  h1{\n    margin: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-3);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400;font-size: var(--text-4xl);\n    line-height:var(--leading-tight);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-display);\n  }\n  .lede{margin:0;max-inline-size:76ch;color:var(--muted-foreground)}\n  .lede code,.foot code{\n    font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:var(--text-xs);background:var(--secondary);\n    padding: 1px var(--space-1);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);\n  }\n  .tablewrap{flex:1;min-block-size:0;display:flex}\n  table{\n    inline-size:100%;block-size:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:var(--card);\n    border:var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  th{\n    text-align:start;font-size: var(--text-xs);letter-spacing: var(--tracking-caps);text-transform:uppercase;\n    color:var(--muted-foreground);font-weight:700;padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);\n    border-block-end:var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--border);background:var(--secondary);\n  }\n  td{padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);border-block-end:var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--border);vertical-align:middle}\n  tr:last-child td{border-block-end:none}\n  .file{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size: var(--text-sm);white-space:nowrap}\n  .num{font-family:var(--font-mono);text-align:end;inline-size:96px}\n  .cite{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size: var(--text-xs);color:var(--muted-foreground);inline-size:220px}\n  .open{color:var(--accent)}\n  tbody tr:nth-child(1) .file{font-weight:700}\n  .foot{flex:none;display:grid;gap: var(--space-2);border-block-start:var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--border);padding-top: var(--space-6)}\n  .foot p{margin:0;font-size: var(--text-sm);color:var(--muted-foreground);max-inline-size:112ch}\n\n.tablewrap { overflow-x: auto; min-inline-size: 0 }\n/* page frame — docs/theme.md#page-frame */\n:root { --page-measure: 72rem; --space-page: var(--space-5); }\n@media (width >= 48rem) { :root { --space-page: var(--space-8); } }\n\ncode{font-family:var(--font-mono)}</style>\n<div class=\"sheet\" data-kid=\"1\">\n<header data-kid=\"1-1\">\n<p class=\"kicker\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">Canvas index</p>\n<h1 data-kid=\"1-1-2\">Chef Llama design canvases</h1>\n<p class=\"lede\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"lede paragraph describing canvas split\">Split on 17 November 2026 from the single <code data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\">chef-llama.canvas</code>. One canvas per surface, so a topic reads end to end without crossing the board. The three core-loop surfaces — <code data-kid=\"1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"pantry.canvas file code in lede\">pantry.canvas</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-1-3-4\" data-name=\"recipe.canvas file code in lede\">recipe.canvas</code> and <code data-kid=\"1-1-3-5\" data-name=\"saved.canvas file code in lede\">saved.canvas</code> — were drawn on 19 November 2026 in the saffron inversion palette. <code data-kid=\"1-1-3-6\" data-name=\"account.canvas file code in lede\">account.canvas</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-1-3-7\" data-name=\"chart.canvas file code in lede\">chart.canvas</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-1-3-8\" data-name=\"brand.canvas file code in lede\">brand.canvas</code> and <code data-kid=\"1-1-3-9\" data-name=\"type.canvas file code in lede\">type.canvas</code> stay on their earlier palettes so earlier judgements remain comparable. Labels are <code data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\">Topic n — what it shows</code>, ordered along the decision trail.</p>\n</header>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\" data-kid=\"1-2\">\n<table data-kid=\"1-2-1\">\n<thead data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\">\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\"><th data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1\">Canvas</th><th data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2\">Holds</th><th class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-3\">Nodes</th><th class=\"cite\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-4\">Cited in docs</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"table body listing canvas rows\">\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"landing.canvas table row (highlighted)\">\n<td class=\"file\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"landing canvas file name\">landing.canvas</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"landing canvas holds summary text\">Four palette sheets of the same landing page, one per token set — and the only copy of the packs section</td>\n<td class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"landing canvas node count\">4</td><td class=\"cite open\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"landing canvas citation source\">theme.md, open</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-7\" data-name=\"pantry.canvas table row\">\n<td class=\"file\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-7-1\" data-name=\"pantry canvas file name\">pantry.canvas</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-7-2\" data-name=\"pantry canvas holds summary text\">Core loop: working screen, first-run Diet dialog, generating state, narrow empty</td>\n<td class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-7-3\" data-name=\"pantry canvas node count\">4</td><td class=\"cite\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-7-4\" data-name=\"pantry canvas citation source\">product.md</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-8\" data-name=\"recipe.canvas table row\">\n<td class=\"file\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-8-1\" data-name=\"recipe canvas file name\">recipe.canvas</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-8-2\" data-name=\"recipe canvas holds summary text\">Public recipe: swap document, 480 sheet, plain with kcal over</td>\n<td class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-8-3\" data-name=\"recipe canvas node count\">3</td><td class=\"cite\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-8-4\" data-name=\"recipe canvas citation source\">product.md</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-9\" data-name=\"saved.canvas table row\">\n<td class=\"file\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-9-1\" data-name=\"saved canvas file name\">saved.canvas</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-9-2\" data-name=\"saved canvas holds summary text\">Saved list with just-added, deferred Save, narrow empty</td>\n<td class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-9-3\" data-name=\"saved canvas node count\">3</td><td class=\"cite\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-9-4\" data-name=\"saved canvas citation source\">caching.md</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\">\n<td class=\"file\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1\">account.canvas</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-2\">Account states, billing, free cooks, card meta row</td>\n<td class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3\">6</td><td class=\"cite\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4\">product.md</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"brand.canvas table row\">\n<td class=\"file\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"brand canvas file name\">brand.canvas</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"brand canvas holds summary text\">Header sign, toque, animated mark, Start cooking options</td>\n<td class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"brand canvas node count\">4</td><td class=\"cite open\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"brand canvas citation source\">open</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-4\">\n<td class=\"file\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-4-1\">chart.canvas</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"chart.canvas holds summary text\">Bucket states, mark-count arithmetic, value placement, the collected rail</td>\n<td class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"chart.canvas node count\">4</td><td class=\"cite\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-4-4\">chart.md</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-5\">\n<td class=\"file\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-5-1\">type.canvas</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"type.canvas holds summary text\">The chosen allocation, then the two evidence tables it rests on</td>\n<td class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-5-3\" data-name=\"type.canvas node count\">3</td><td class=\"cite\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-5-4\">theme.md</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-6\">\n<td class=\"file\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-6-1\">index.canvas</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-6-2\">This card</td>\n<td class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-6-3\">1</td><td class=\"cite\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-6-4\">—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"foot\" data-kid=\"1-3\">\n<p data-kid=\"1-3-1\">Node ids are unchanged, so the four citations in <code data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\">docs/chart.md</code> still resolve: <code data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\">var_bucketstates_1106</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\">var_markcount_1107</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-3-1-4\">var_narrow_place_1107</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-3-1-5\">var_rail_collect_1107</code>. All four live in <code data-kid=\"1-3-1-6\">chart.canvas</code>.</p>\n<p data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"footer note about superseded pricing.canvas\"><code data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"pricing.canvas file name in note\">pricing.canvas</code> came out on 18 November 2026. Its gauge rail lives in all four landing sheets, at the same prices, credit counts and per-credit rates; the column and stub rails went with the canvas.</p>\n<p data-kid=\"1-3-3\" data-name=\"footer note about design system token rules\">Token names and roles are <code data-kid=\"1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"docs/theme.md file code in note\">docs/theme.md</code> and nowhere else. A node's token block is the palette it was judged in, and no node declares a colour name outside that list. The palette is still open — the four candidates are the landing sheets.</p>\n<p data-kid=\"1-3-4\" data-name=\"footer note listing core loop node ids\">Core-loop node ids, so docs can cite them: <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"pantry.canvas file code in note\">pantry.canvas</code> <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"pantry node id code\">var_3dae9c660aaf</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-3\" data-name=\"pantry node id code\">var_e698064075a5</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-4\" data-name=\"pantry node id code\">var_64043b0f59ad</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-5\" data-name=\"pantry node id code\">var_1e7bf6f84996</code>; <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-6\" data-name=\"recipe.canvas file code in note\">recipe.canvas</code> <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-7\" data-name=\"recipe node id code\">var_200d29bd708a</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-8\" data-name=\"recipe node id code\">var_48ac303b2410</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-9\" data-name=\"recipe node id code\">var_d61cf0ebf75a</code>; <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-10\" data-name=\"saved.canvas file code in note\">saved.canvas</code> <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-11\" data-name=\"saved node id code\">var_bc61e5751ea2</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-12\" data-name=\"saved node id code\">var_6205245906d3</code>, <code data-kid=\"1-3-4-13\" data-name=\"saved node id code\">var_cc33556f5f5c</code>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
